## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests (in-notebook)
- Assert training loss decreases over epochs.
- Assert BLEU-1 > 0.15 and ROUGE-L > 0.20 on validation set (sanity thresholds for a 200-image prototype).
- Verify model can generate coherent answers for 5 held-out test queries (manual inspection cells).

### Manual Verification
- Run inference on 2-3 unseen optical images and 2-3 unseen SAR images with varied questions.
- Visually inspect that answers are in natural language (not class labels) and reference image content.

